    "eventMetadata": {
      "context_description": "T1 enters this KeSPA Cup semifinal Bo5 as clear favorites against DN SOOPers, reflecting their higher world ranking, deeper roster talent including experienced players like Faker, and stronger recent LCK form. DN SOOPers advanced by sweeping Hanwha Life Esports in the quarterfinals, showcasing upset potential through aggressive drafting and coordinated teamfights, though they struggled against T1 in an earlier group-stage Bo1. Key variables include patch 26.14 meta shifts favoring T1’s versatile picks, individual carry performances on both sides, and best-of-five adaptation in drafts. T1’s experience in high-stakes series and consistent macro execution contrast with DNS’s momentum from lower-bracket runs, keeping the matchup competitive despite the implied probability gap.",
